        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9448/100 Elegant Solid Brass Cabinet Drop Pull</b>\r\n<p>This romantically designed cabinet pull is made of solid brass. It is available in 5 finishes, all of which grant the cabinet pull an old world charm. The handle is shaped to fit comfortably in the hand. The designs are intricate but not overly so, making this cabinet drop pull excellent for homes with fancier decors.</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Similar design <a href=\"/site/department.cfm?id=41701\"><b>Omnia Ornate Cabinet Pulls</b></a>. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nOmnia's line of sophisticated cabinet hardware have been painstakingly crafted by artisans who understand that a beautiful design must be as comfortable to the hand as it is pleasing to the eyes.\r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>Specifications</b> of the Decorative Series Omnia 9448/100 Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Handle Length: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Length : 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Width: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass construction regardless of finish.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually</b>\r\n</p>",
